WEBVTT

00:01:57.581 --> 00:02:00.904
to detect early and intervene early.

00:02:00.904 --> 00:02:03.039
Early detection, early intervention,

00:02:03.039 --> 00:02:06.109
that's the story for these successes.

00:02:06.109 --> 00:02:08.845
Unfortunately, the news is not all good.

00:02:08.845 --> 00:02:11.194
Let's talk about one other story

00:02:11.194 --> 00:02:12.885
which has to do with suicide.

00:02:12.885 --> 00:02:15.537
Now this is, of course, not a disease, per se.

00:02:15.537 --> 00:02:18.625
It's a condition, or it's a situation

00:02:18.625 --> 00:02:20.414
that leads to mortality.

00:02:20.414 --> 00:02:23.494
What you may not realize is just how prevalent it is.

00:02:23.494 --> 00:02:27.703
There are 38,000 suicides each year in the United States.

00:02:27.703 --> 00:02:30.461
That means one about every 15 minutes.